                        <rule id="r57-iw-pert-retinue-dominator-cohort-r57-iw-dom-armoury-shrapnel-rule" name="Shrapnel Bolts" hidden="false">
                          <description>Bolt Pistols, Bolters, Combi-Bolters, Storm Bolters, Heavy Bolters, Twin-linked Bolters and bolter components of Combi-Weapons carried by models in this unit gain Pinning. May not be combined with Special Issue Ammunition, Hellfire Rounds or another special ammunition type.

Pinning: Unsaved Wounds caused by this weapon force the unit to take a Pinning Test.</description>
